## Next Steps

If I had more time, I would continue improving both the functionality and user experience of the site.

One improvement would be adding interactive filtering or search functionality, so users can quickly find recipes instead of scrolling through categories.

I would also enhance the design by adding more micro-interactions and animations, such as smoother transitions between pages or hover effects for images.

Another potential improvement would be improving accessibility, including better color contrast, semantic HTML structure, and support for screen readers.

Finally, I would continue expanding the site by adding more recipes and possibly organizing them with tags or difficulty levels to make the content more structured and user-friendly.